WEBVTT

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.080
I-I wonder why it feels awkward in the room...

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:32.410
You needn't worry... since I'm
a better judge of people than you.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.620
Kurusu.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.000
Y-Yeah?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.790
About the rehearsal for the school festival...

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.750
Are you feeling sick by any chance?

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.040
Kurusu?!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.700
H-Hey, are you okay?!

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:47.580
I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.000
P-Practice! Let's practice already!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.410
O-Okay.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.790
Crap... It feels more awkward than I thought.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:04.200
Though it was an accident, it seems like it
bothered her enough to make her cry.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.950
But if I sincerely apologize, I'm sure she'll...

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.250
Hozuki!

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.450
Why did I turn my face away
from him so obviously?

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:16.120
If I had said, "It wasn't a big deal"
just now, like I always do,

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.580
things could've gone back to normal.

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.700
Grrrr! Are there any naughty kids?

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.500
We're gonna eat you!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.910
Just kidding.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:26.500
Did you get scared? Did you?

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.330
We're gonna wear these costumes for our
haunted house at the school festival.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.790
--Wow, cool...
--Look at Chika and Hozuki.
It was so shocking that it dazed them.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:34.000
--You guys are your usual selves
and I think it's really good.
--Look at Chika and Hozuki.
It was so shocking that it dazed them.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:34.370
--It was a big success!

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:35.540
--Huh?
--It was a big success!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.830
"Koto Club"

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.580
"Koto Club"
"#16    Their Time"

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.410
"#16    Their Time"
Oh, shoot! I made another mistake!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.450
We're not really together at all.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.830
Ahh... That's enough.
Let's call it a day. Dismissed.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:18.950
What? Why?

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:22.750
Poor-quality practice lowers your motivation
and nothing good comes of it.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:27.120
If you want to practice, go ahead and do it
individually. But don't play together.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.540
It's because I couldn't focus...

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.120
I'm sorry!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:34.120
It's probably because
I'm not good at the 17-string.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:39.200
I think we lack unity because I can't
lead you guys like Hozuki can.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.080
What am I doing being distracted
when they're working hard?

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.080
Especially when Suzu is finally motivated...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.160
I'm being so terrible at
sensing the atmosphere.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.540
Let's practice!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:51.750
Hiro...

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.080
I wasn't focusing earlier. I'm sorry!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.500
I know what Suzu said,
but we don't have many days left.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.830
So let's play together!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:03.250
Yeah... Let's do it.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.950
All right! Let's do it!

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:05.580
--Well then, let's try from the start again.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.000
--This is no time to be distraught
over something like that.
--Well then, let's try from the start again.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.540
I need to focus on
the school festival right now.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:15.120
I have to hurry up and get rid of these
feelings that can disturb the mood.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.160
Are you feeling better now, Kurusu?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.000
What? What're you talking about?

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:25.000
Well, you were acting a little strange
when we started practice, so...

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.500
Oh, that. Since the school festival
is nearing, I was a little distracted.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.580
I'm sorry.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.120
Yeah? Okay then.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.790
Sorry that I worried you.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.200
I'm sorry.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.200
What?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.370
It's true that I got shaken up,
but I was the one who moved suddenly.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.080
So you're the victim here.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.620
I'm sorry for acting strange
over a mere accident.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.500
Hozuki...

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.330
Okay. Everything's settled now.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.040
Well then, see you tomorrow.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.830
Y-Yeah.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.410
What? It's good that it's been resolved.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.950
Yeah. Something kinda
doesn't feel right, though.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.120
I can talk to her like I usually do, right?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.000
H-Hey.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.450
Good morning.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.870
Ah... By the way, Hozuki--

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.080
I'm in a hurry, so...

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.750
What?

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.200
She probably can't help it...

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.450
...since it bothered her enough to make her cry.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:31.080
Even if her head tells her to act normally,
it probably takes time.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:34.700
Dammit! If only I had quicker reflexes...

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.580
I don't think that's it.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.500
Anyway, why don't you give her
a little space for now?

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.250
Things will probably go back
to normal with time.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.910
"Koto Club"
Hozuki. Do you already have a shortlist
for the national qualifier?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.540
"Koto Club"
Yes. I brought a few pieces.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:54.000
Wow, this is great! Lots of pieces here.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.870
I'm interested in this one.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.660
Hey, Chika. You should check this CD out, too.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.580
Yeah.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.910
What's the titl--

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.370
Let me see the one you have, Sane.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:13.040
With time, things will go back
to normal. With time...

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.830
"Tokise School Festival"

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.290
"Haunted House"
Come one, come all!
We're doing a haunted house!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.950
Ah! Hiro!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.000
Kota!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.040
Wow! Cute costume!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.700
You look good in it!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.500
Thanks. Oh? You guys are wearing
different costumes from the other day.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.160
The girls in our class turned them down.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.660
They told us to wear these.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.330
Y-You look good in them.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.830
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:51.160
Oh, I'm sorry, Kurusu... for having
you go pick them up by yourself.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.330
H-He looks cute...

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:54.290
...not!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.290
Kurusu?!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:59.250
H-How frightening a school festival can be.
I'd better not let my guard down.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.750
You look good in that costume. You look cute.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.910
Do you wanna get hurt?!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:03.910
Sorry!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.910
"Japanese-Style Cafe"
"Green Tea 150 yen
<i>Hojicha </i>Latte 150 yen
Strawberry <i>Daifuku </i>200 yen"

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.660
Thank you for waiting.
Here's your matcha latte and--

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.290
Wow! You're cute!

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:14.120
Huh?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.250
Hey, why don't you leave this place
and come hang with us for a while?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.950
I'm sorry, but I'm busy, so...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.040
What's the big deal? It's just for a little bit.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.370
Please let go of me.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.580
Sure. I'll let you go after you
tell me your name.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.250
Wha--?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.580
Owww!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:32.250
I'm Chika Kudo. A Virgo born on
September 2nd. Blood type O.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.790
Anything else you wanna know?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.660
N-No, we're good.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.830
I still can't...

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.160
I can't look Kudo in the eyes.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.370
My face still feels hot.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.700
Why...? What do I do?

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.410
I just want things to go back to normal...

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.250
Are you okay?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.910
Shut up, stupid.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.540
You stupid Tetsuki.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.910
He's really feeling down, huh?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.200
2-A is serving waffles!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:08.790
Glad that I picked the barker role.
This way, I don't have to see Kurata so much.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.080
Welcome!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.500
Ah, excuse me. Is Kurata here?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.160
Ah, yes, he is.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.250
Who's this?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:18.910
Takezo!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:30.000
What?! Mashiro?! Y-You came?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.200
Yep. I came because I wanted to see you.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.540
You look cute in that costume.

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:38.040
Oh, stop it. You could've told me
that you were coming.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.750
I wanted to surprise you.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.160
I haven't even been gone that long,
but you look so much more mature now!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.750
Well, that's...

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.450
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:51.160
I'm so surprised by your sudden visit
that I don't know what to say.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:01.370
Actually, we're going to have our koto
performance at 12:30 in the gym.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.200
Really?! I'll come!
I'll definitely come hear it!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.370
Wait. Were you able to get
permission to use the stage?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:10.700
If I remember correctly, you need
more than five people to get it.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.500
There are seven members
in the koto club right now.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.580
Seven... members...

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.540
No way... That's incredible...

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.750
That's amazing, Takezo.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.200
You must've worked really hard. That's amazing.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.410
Well, I didn't do anything special.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.330
You did a good job.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.000
Well then, see you later.
I look forward to your performance!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.290
Okay!

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:43.080
Ah, Kurusu! Shoot, I should've
introduced you to her.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:46.120
That person was the previous
koto club president.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:49.290
Since I was the only first year in the club
last year, she was very nice to me.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.120
It doesn't...

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.000
What?

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.950
It doesn't have anything to do with me.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.450
You're... right. I'm sorry.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.450
I really hurt his feelings just now.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.500
Far from getting rid of
my feelings towards him,

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.370
I got jealous and took it out on him?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.500
What am I doing? I'm so terrible!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:14.160
I knew very little about Kurata
when we were first years.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:17.080
When I was tricking and hurting people,

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.250
he continued working hard
on his club activities

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.620
while being called "Nadeshiko."

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.660
And I was just looking down
on him with the others.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.700
I know nothing about their history
that led to that conversation, either.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:32.620
But even so, if I'm still
allowed to take part...

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:33.540
Kurata!

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:37.750
F-Forget what I just said. I was just
taking it out on you. I'm sorry!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.250
That person is someone dear to you, right?

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:43.040
I'll do my best in the performance

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.620
so that you can be proud of
the current koto club!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.700
So... um...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.870
Kurusu.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.410
Thank you.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.700
Listen! The previous club president
is here to see our performance.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.450
So let's give it everything we've got!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.660
President Takezo's president, huh?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.830
Then she's like our super president.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.000
We'd better do a good job.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.450
Yeah. I'll try very hard.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.450
You don't have to try so hard.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:16.450
Let's enjoy our performance on stage
to the fullest. That's what she told me.

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:20.160
It'll be fine. I'm borrowing a line
from the previous club president,

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:24.790
but performing on stage is
a reward for our hard work.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:28.040
So we can just enjoy it to the fullest.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:32.200
It <i>does </i>have something to do with me.
I was already connected to her.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:37.870
When I was the only club member,
her words were my support every day.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:39.620
So I'm really happy

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:45.080
that the day when we, the current koto club,
can play for her has come!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:55.450
Next is the performance by our koto club.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.040
This is great... There really are seven members.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.330
On top of that, there are so many boys.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.830
Wow... Aren't they good? They look like
they're having fun performing.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.120
Yeah.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:24.370
During practice, some of them looked
like they were feeling uneasy,

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:29.370
so I thought they'd be really distracted
during the performance, but...

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:36.540
I guess the most important thing
for all of them must be the same.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.120
They really are... an interesting bunch.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:47.120
Seriously! You guys were so cool!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.160
Really?!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.540
I-Is that right?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.580
You're so good!
You stayed together very well, too!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.330
I found myself totally drawn in!
It was really amazing!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.700
Yaay! I like you, Mashiron!

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.120
She hasn't changed.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:05.580
Okay, guys. Don't monopolize her.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.950
She and Kurata have a lot of catching-up to do.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:11.950
Kurata. Don't worry about us.
Go on and talk with her.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:12.790
What? But...

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.660
Just go.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.450
Kurusu... right?

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.330
Ah, yes.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.870
Thank you for everything.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:22.410
Takezo must feel at ease
having someone like you

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.080
as the club vice president.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.290
I'm not sure about that.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.830
She really is cute.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.370
Well, then... Thanks.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.200
No problem! Please take your time!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.370
She's such a nice person.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.080
Yeah.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.410
Was that okay?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.080
Huh? W-Was what okay?

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:43.660
Nothing.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.160
Suzu! Come with me!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.540
Hiro?

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.450
Wh-What the heck?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:14:00.250
I was really surprised by the number
of members as well as your abilities.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:04.660
Thank you very much.
I'm happy to hear that from you.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.250
At first, I was really worried that I
might not be able to keep my promise

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.200
to protect the club.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.160
But I was very lucky to find good friends.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:19.000
Also, the words you gave me
helped me so many times.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.950
Really?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:24.290
To be honest, I was regretting...

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:29.410
...saying things to you like, "We'll leave
the club to you," and "You'll be fine."

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.330
What?

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:34.500
I thought I said very selfish,
cruel things to you.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.620
When I saw you alone in
the clubroom on our graduation day,

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.660
I thought that from then on, you'd
have to recruit club members

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.250
and do activities as the club
president all by yourself.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.330
I thought you'd be worried,
and that it would be a lot of work.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:53.700
I thought that I might've bound you with
words and driven you into a corner...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:58.450
...and that I might've forced
the "end" of the club on you.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:02.660
That's so terrible, isn't it? It means
that I didn't have complete faith in you.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.040
Really, I'm sorry.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.660
Oh, that?

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.040
"That"?!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.750
You don't have to worry about things like that.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.790
Whether you had complete faith in me or not,

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.790
it doesn't change the fact that
those words from you gave me power.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.290
You totally are a club president now.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.790
Oh, please stop!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:34.200
S-Suzu... Um... You're aware... right?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.200
Aware of what?

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.000
You must be aware!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.330
That's why you said what
you said earlier, right?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.870
Did I say something?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.950
I'll make sure...!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:47.120
I-I'll make sure that I get rid
of these feelings.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.750
I'll make sure that I won't cause
trouble for the club! So...

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.870
Why do you have to get rid of them?

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.450
"Why"?

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:59.910
Because when everyone is working hard
at the club, if I'm distracted,

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.290
that's selfish. That's no good.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:08.830
Honestly, I really don't see what's
selfish about liking someone.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:12.120
I don't get the whole causing
trouble thing, either.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:16.370
As long as we're alive, we cause trouble
and others cause us trouble...

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.250
...romance or not.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:20.540
Hey, Suzu... What're you saying?

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.950
Nothing special. I'm just saying
what I think, that's all.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:27.950
If a club goes down just because
one member has a crush on another,

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.200
it just means that's the level of that club.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.750
If you want to do something about it,
turn "that" into power.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.330
Is it okay to turn it into power?

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.830
Is it okay to have feelings like that?

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:55.910
"Koto Club"

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.290
"Koto Club"
All right! Done putting the kotos away!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.450
I wonder if Hiro and Mr. Takinami
are coming back here.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.700
Probably. He said he wanted to talk to us
about the piece for the qualifier.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:09.370
Then let's go around to the booths
and get some food while we can.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:10.450
Sounds good!

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:13.000
Then I'll wait here for Hiro and Mr. Takinami.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.870
Then we'll get something for you, too.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.370
Thanks.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.620
Let's go, Chika!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.790
I feel lazy, so I'll wait here, too.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.250
Chika! Don't take the easy way out!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.160
Shut up! Go already!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.120
O-Oh no... What do I do?

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.410
Ah... On second thought, I'll go with--

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:32.790
Hozuki...

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.500
Excuse me...

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.080
"Excuse me"?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.620
Um...

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:49.000
Can you tell me... what I need to do
to make things right with you?

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:53.500
It's just... I really feel bad about
making you feel so uncomfortable.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.910
I wanted to apologize,
but you've been kinda avoiding me.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.200
So, um...

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:01.160
I am... truly sorry.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.870
Oh, Chika! We ran into
Mr. Takinami right outside!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.620
Wait, wait, wait!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.950
Why'd you close the door like that?!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.330
Well, I didn't wanna
interrupt your conversation.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.750
It's too late! You're here to
talk about the piece, right?

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.910
The shortlist for the national qualifier...

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.950
Oh, did you listen to them?
I'm thinking of choosing one of them.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.290
I don't think they're quite right.
No to all of them.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.290
What?

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.750
Hozuki. Bring in all
the koto recordings you have.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.290
Um... What specifically was the problem?

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:41.580
There's no piece among them that can
take you guys to nationals. That's all.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.750
But difficulty-wise, I think all of them
are good enough for the--

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.830
It's not a matter of difficulty.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:51.290
So, for that reason, play this
until I've decided on the piece.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:55.410
It's a piece for practicing hand movements,
so it's not fun or anything, though.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.700
Tell Kurata and Kurusu about it, too.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:02.830
To them, the next qualifier is their
last chance to go to nationals.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.160
What?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.660
What're you talking about?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.580
They're second years.
Why is it gonna be their last chance?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:13.040
Oh? You guys weren't aware?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.250
The qualifier takes place
either in fall or winter.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:19.410
And the actual nationals take place
in the summer of the following year.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.250
So even if they get past
the qualifier as third years,

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:26.830
they can't go to nationals since they'll
have already graduated by then.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:32.000
If you lose in the next qualifier,
they won't be able to go to nationals.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:36.200
So to them, it's their last chance.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:39.120
Thank you very much for coming today.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.330
No. Thank <i>you</i>.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:43.410
You're gonna participate
in the national qualifier, right?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.750
Yes.

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.620
With the current Tokise koto club,

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.040
I feel like nationals are
no longer a pipe dream,

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.040
even though we were nowhere
near it when I was in the club.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:56.370
You were third years, and yet,
you aimed for nationals for me.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.250
That alone made me happy.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:02.790
Even if we had passed the qualifier,
you couldn't have gone to nationals,

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.750
but you still tried hard with me.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.200
If we were actually able to get
the ticket to nationals for you,

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.000
that would've been cool, though.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:13.660
Even so, I was really happy.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.700
Their last chance...

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:21.750
If we should fail, that'll be it.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.910
No way!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:27.830
Among the first years who joined the club,
there's a very skilled player.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.790
Then practice.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:34.500
The other first years and Kurusu
are rapidly getting more skilled.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.540
They practice very hard.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.700
If you don't want it to be
the last one for them,

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:42.000
practice like crazy for the next two months.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.870
So I don't want the next
competition to be our last.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:48.080
Do it efficiently, frantically, and devotedly...

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:51.830
...so that you can think with confidence
that no one practiced more than you did.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:54.580
Even after all that, nationals
are still hard to reach.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.040
With those guys...

00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:00.450
...I'll give it everything
I've got until the very end.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.700
Yep!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.120
Good luck!

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.200
Hey!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.120
Chika...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.080
Hozuki. Actually, you don't have
to bring in the music.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.830
What? But...

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.580
I'll drive, so let's go
to your place to grab them.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.160
It's a school festival day.
It should be okay to step out.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.410
Okay. That'd be great since I'd like
to know which piece you decide on

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.000
as soon as possible.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.080
Kudo. This practice piece
uses the <i>hirajoshi </i>scale.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.870
Here's the tuner.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.620
Thanks.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.750
Their last chance...

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:24.080
Dammit. None of these sound good.

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:31.830
"National Koto Competition"

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:33.080
"National Koto Competition"
I found it.

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.200
Next time, "Reunion."

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:54.540
"#17    Reunion"
